I see this a lot.

473
00:28:27,056 --> 00:28:30,756
People say, oh, there's volatility in the market. That's great because now the market is going to trend.

474
00:28:30,756 --> 00:28:32,856
No, it's just going to go up and down oftentimes.

475
00:28:33,556 --> 00:28:35,656
Because now you have increased trading activity.

476
00:28:35,656 --> 00:28:40,056
It doesn't necessarily, you like to think it's going to potentially be the start of a trend.

477
00:28:40,156 --> 00:28:47,256
I mean, if you remember during COVID, volatility is off the Richter scale and you got a lot of trends.

